## ----- physiological (6 entries) -----

<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MFOEM_000203> a owl:NamedIndividual , cbc:PhysiologicalContext ;
    cb:slug      "feeling_of_pain" ;
    cb:category  cbc:PhysiologicalContext ;
    rdfs:label   "feeling of pain"@en ;
    cb:source    "MFOEM" ;
    dcterms:source cb:Source_MFOEM ;
    skos:definition "A <subjective affective feeling> in an organism S, involving two integrated levels: (a) activation of the nociceptive system and associated emotion generating brain components of S, and (b) a simultaneous aversive sensory and emotional experience on the part of S, where (b) is phenomenologically similar to the sort of aversive experience involved in pain with concordant tissue damage."@en .

