    skos:definition "An <inform about emotional consequences BCT> that provides information about the positive emotional consequences of performing or not performing the behaviour."@en .

<http://humanbehaviourchange.org/ontology/BCIO_007182> a owl:NamedIndividual , cbc:BehaviourChangeTechnique ;
    cb:slug      "inform_about_positive_environmental_consequences_bct" ;
