    skos:definition "An <inform about health consequences BCT> that provides information about the positive physical or mental health consequences of performing or not performing the behaviour."@en .

<http://humanbehaviourchange.org/ontology/BCIO_007184> a owl:NamedIndividual , cbc:BehaviourChangeTechnique ;
